1900–1901 was Celtic's 13th season of competitive football. As members of the [[Scottish Football Association]], they competed in the [[Scottish First Division]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.londonhearts.com/scores/a1900/celtic1901.htm|title=Results for Celtic for 1900-01|website=www.londonhearts.com}}</ref> Celtic ended the league as runners-up and could not retain their [[Scottish Cup]] trophy, losing the final 3-4 to [[Heart of Midlothian F.C.|Heart of Midlothian]].

